{"candidateAnswer":"Well-known fantasy and literary fiction authors","evidence":"[D1:14 | 7:48 pm on 21 May, 2023] Tim: It's been going well! Last week I talked to my friend who is a fan of Harry Potter and we're figuring out ideas, so it's been great to get lost in that magical world!\n[D2:7 | 5:08 pm on 15 June, 2023] Tim: Yeah, John! Count on me for support. Can't wait to see what's up! This is my book collection so far.\n[D4:7 | 4:17 pm on 2 August, 2023] Tim: For sure! Harry Potter and Game of Thrones are amazing - I'm totally hooked! I could chat about them forever!\n[D5:15 | 10:29 am on 9 August, 2023] Tim: It's a book by Patrick Rothfuss and it's awesome! The way the author builds the world and characters is amazing. You should read it!\n[D20:21 | 9:52 am on 1 December, 2023] Tim: Glad you like it! The Hobbit is great, but have you read that other popular fantasy series? It's also awesome!\n[D26:36 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] Tim: I'm really excited to watch this new show that's coming out called \"The Wheel of Time\". It's based on a book series that I love.\n[UNRESOLVED DATASET EVIDENCE ANNOTATION: D:11:26]","itemId":"urn:uuid:fcf741e3-bb54-59e7-8fd3-64e76170a7d4","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6a6f5bae86227c8f89fe0c8ecf4e9d337c9c6f6fae2aaf93733e387882ec63de","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What authors has Tim read books from?","referenceAnswer":"J.K. Rowling, R.R. Martin, Patrick Rothfuss, Paulo Coelho, and J. R. R. Tolkien.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6a6f5bae86227c8f89fe0c8ecf4e9d337c9c6f6fae2aaf93733e387882ec63de"}}]}